{"4889910":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Immune Response","steam_appid":4889910,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5077610],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMMUNE RESPONSE<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immune Response is a fast-paced twin-stick shooter where you control a white blood cell named Phil. Your mission is to eradicate the unwelcome pathogenic guests living in your host's body.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5 FUN GAME MODES<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic<\/strong> - Survive for as long as you can against growing hordes of infectious enemies.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Waves<\/strong> - See if you can conquer all 55 challenging waves of enemies.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vaccinate<\/strong> - No shooting here! You must build up your booster to take down your foes in this game mode.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Worm<\/strong> - Slow down with a thematic twist on the classic &quot;Snake&quot; game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KP<\/strong> - YOU become the virus and must take down specialized boss enemies, each with their own distinct attacks and styles.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4889910\/extras\/a2dcf54b67d7e2b95cef574d3c871df9.poster.avif?t=1793642459\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4889910\/extras\/a2dcf54b67d7e2b95cef574d3c871df9.webm?t=1793642459\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4889910\/extras\/a2dcf54b67d7e2b95cef574d3c871df9.mp4?t=1793642459\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLOCKABLE CHARACTERS<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as your favorite fallen foes once they are defeated.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4889910\/extras\/6370da31c7eeeaf760bc0a5217a9a39d.webp?t=1793642459\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4889910\/extras\/6370da31c7eeeaf760bc0a5217a9a39d.poster.avif?t=1793642459\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=256 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMMUNE RESPONSE<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immune Response is a fast-paced twin-stick shooter where you control a white blood cell named Phil. Your mission is to eradicate the unwelcome pathogenic guests living in your host's body.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5 FUN GAME MODES<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic<\/strong> - Survive for as long as you can against growing hordes of infectious enemies.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Waves<\/strong> - See if you can conquer all 55 challenging waves of enemies.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vaccinate<\/strong> - No shooting here! You must build up your booster to take down your foes in this game mode.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Worm<\/strong> - Slow down with a thematic twist on the classic &quot;Snake&quot; game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KP<\/strong> - YOU become the virus and must take down specialized boss enemies, each with their own distinct attacks and styles.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4889910\/extras\/a2dcf54b67d7e2b95cef574d3c871df9.poster.avif?t=1793642459\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4889910\/extras\/a2dcf54b67d7e2b95cef574d3c871df9.webm?t=1793642459\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4889910\/extras\/a2dcf54b67d7e2b95cef574d3c871df9.mp4?t=1793642459\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLOCKABLE CHARACTERS<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as your favorite fallen foes once they are defeated.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4889910\/extras\/6370da31c7eeeaf760bc0a5217a9a39d.webp?t=1793642459\"><img src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4889910\/extras\/6370da31c7eeeaf760bc0a5217a9a39d.poster.avif?t=1793642459\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=256 \/><\/picture><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"An exciting twin-stick shooter with a progressively increasing difficulty. Fight waves of pathogenic enemies, face difficult boss fights and survive for as long as you can!","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4889910\/adfdc2656ad708aa230c9e1cddf5b05f7bdef1c9\/header.jpg?t=1793642459","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4889910\/9fa9b2edc2347820556becb566ad7114075c74d1\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793642459","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4889910\/9fa9b2edc2347820556becb566ad7114075c74d1\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793642459","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/stron